Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好  那你要一起办吗  乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, great. So do you wanna do it together? I would love to do it together.{\r}
