Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我要接班  然后去参加大试镜{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm picking up Ben and then we're off to the big audition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看到有演员假装是班的父亲  那种感觉一定很怪{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's gonna be weird to watch some actor pretending to be Ben's dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}是啊  能怪过看到班的两个妈妈温存吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah. Weirder than his two moms making out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}爸爸  广告里面有爸爸{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Whoa, whoa. Dad? There's a dad in the commercial?{\r}
