Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}说到扮演班的爸爸  由我这教父上场最适合了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I mean, who better to play Ben's father than his godfather?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你不是班的教父  什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're not his godfather. What?{\r}
