Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs17\bord1\shad1\1c&HFFE0EC&\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当然是啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs8\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Of course I am.{\r}
